{"id": "evt_b550535f8ce9", "timestamp": "2026-03-21T22:37:09.561878+00:00", "run_id": "run_b91d5945dc88", "type": "tool.called", "payload": {"tool_call_id": "call_f2c05c34d5c4434692c3a2b3b718__thought__", "tool_name": "northwind__query", "arguments": {"sql": "SELECT \n    strftime('%Y-%m', o.OrderDate) as Month,\n    SUM(od.UnitPrice * od.Quantity * (1 - od.Discount)) as TotalRevenue,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT o.OrderID) as NumOrders,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT o.CustomerID) as NumCustomers,\n    SUM(od.UnitPrice * od.Quantity * (1 - od.Discount)) / COUNT(DISTINCT o.OrderID) as AvgOrderValue\nFROM Orders o\nJOIN \"Order Details\" od ON o.OrderID = od.OrderID\nWHERE strftime('%Y-%m', o.OrderDate) IN ('2023-09', '2023-08')\nGROUP BY Month"}}}
{"id": "evt_7aa743194c0b", "timestamp": "2026-03-21T22:37:09.682085+00:00", "run_id": "run_b91d5945dc88", "type": "tool.completed", "payload": {"tool_call_id": "call_f2c05c34d5c4434692c3a2b3b718__thought__", "tool_name": "northwind__query", "result": "{\n  \"columns\": [\n    \"Month\",\n    \"TotalRevenue\",\n    \"NumOrders\",\n    \"NumCustomers\",\n    \"AvgOrderValue\"\n  ],\n  \"rows\": [\n    [\n      \"2023-08\",\n      3293158.67,\n      110,\n      60,\n      29937.80609090909\n    ],\n    [\n      \"2023-09\",\n      3544698.51,\n      119,\n      66,\n      29787.38243697479\n    ]\n  ],\n  \"row_count\": 2\n}"}}
{"id": "evt_2d7a8764c6ec", "timestamp": "2026-03-21T22:37:12.094825+00:00", "run_id": "run_b91d5945dc88", "type": "summary.generated", "payload": {"step_index": 1, "summary": "Aggregated sales data for the most recent complete month (September 2023) and compared it to the previous month (August 2023).\n\n**September 2023 Metrics:**\n- Total Revenue: 3,544,698.51\n- Number of Orders: 119\n- Unique Customers: 66\n- Average Order Value: 29,787.38\n\n**Comparison (vs August 2023):**\n- Revenue increased from 3,293,158.67 to 3,544,698.51.\n- Order volume increased from 110 to 119.\n- Customer count increased from 60 to 66.\n- Average order value slightly decreased from 29,937.81 to 29,787.38."}}
