 our primary revenue driver, led by the high-performing *C\u00f4te de Blaye*. However, the loss of 17 previously active customers and a notable decline in US order volume warrant immediate attention. We recommend a focused outreach program to address potential churn and a deeper analysis of the US market to ensure this dip does not become a long-term trend, while simultaneously exploring the positive momentum observed in the Brazilian market.\n\n"}}
